{"id":"vod_sn_37800","vodId":"37800","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"黑冢","name_cn":"黑冢","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/42716c2e2be0d7196bf865318fbcb276.jpg"},"summary":"遭人追杀的源九郎（宫野真守 配音）和武藏坊弁庆（中田让治 配音）于深山之中偶然遇见了名为黑蜜（朴璐美 配音）的神秘女子，随着时间的推移，源九郎和黑蜜相爱了，目睹这一切的弁庆心中很是愤愤不平，然而他并不知道的是，黑蜜的真实身份，竟然是活了千年的吸血鬼。 在嫉妒心的怂恿之下，弁庆背叛了源九郎，投靠了敌人，使得源九郎身份暴露，遭到了敌方的追杀。身负重伤源九郎命不久矣，为了挽救爱人，黑蜜将源九郎变为了吸血鬼。然而，在仪式尚未完成之时，弁庆赶到，在误打误撞之中亦吞下了源九郎的血液。三人交织的复杂关系就这样一直延续，永远没有尽头。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:55:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yctzp1qJ051/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/07CB5EcHjR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UiNLR4uQdc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pq4RENP5yU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Qt8W7K7S8v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/e56qdHg09s1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HyUGDwyGmF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QhmqCfgMXV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qQPZgEuv3c1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6HmgQEdhSD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QYpwMBKa7v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5H1MFhwe651/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:06.648Z"}